<!--
This file configures the default player attributes used in the game
If player 0 is configured it is the base for all players.
If other players are configured they inherit from player 0

@player This configures the player
	@number [default: 0] Number of the player, value can be 1,2,3,4 or 0. Value of 0 means all players.
	@height Height in doom units
	@size  Width and depth of the collision box
	@movespeed Movement speed in doom units per second
	@moveacceleration [optional] Movement speed acceleration. If not specified the player reaches max speed instantly.
	@moveslowdown [optional] Movement speed slowdown when no input is given. If not specified stops instantly

	@strafespeed [default> movespeed] Strafing speed
	@strafeacceleration [optional] Strafe speed acceleration
	@strafeslowdown [optional] Strafe speed slowdown

	@turnspeed Turning speed in degrees per second
	@turnacceleration [optional] Turning acceleration. If not specified reaches turnspeed instantly
	@turnslowdown [optional] Turning slowdown. If not specified stops turning immediately

	@jumpspeed Speed of the jump upwards. This is the minimum speed that is reached even with one frame press
	@jumpduration How long the jump button can be held down. In seconds. Each second adds @jumpspeed more speed

	@climbheight How tall stairs the character can climb automatically

	@inventory This configures the player default items
		@item This configures one item and amount in inventory
			Item must have one of the following:
			@name Name of the item
			@number Number of the item

			@amount [default: 1] How many of this item player has

-->
